<title>UKRAINE: SOCCER-UKRAINE BEAT PORTUGAL 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UKRAINE BEAT PORTUGAL 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine beat Portugal 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in their European under-21 group nine soccer qualifier on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Oleh Haras (38th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
